  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "8425b6f9-ee06-4cea-a8fc-05acb9982146",
    "name": "Food Info Recipes API API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "Nutrition data for millions of foods, merged from five national food-composition datasets: USDA FoodData Central (US), McCance & Widdowson's CoFID (UK), ANSES Ciqual (France), the Danish Food Composition Database, and FSANZ AUSNUT (Australia/NZ), plus Open Food Facts for branded products.\n\nAuthenticate with an API key in the `X-Api-Key` header. A free account gets a key with 10 requests/minute and 100/day; the Practitioner plan raises that to 60/minute and 10,000/day. Quotas are counted per account, not per key. Every response carries `X-RateLimit-Limit-Minute`, `X-RateLimit-Limit-Day` and `X-RateLimit-Tier`.\n\nServer-to-server only: CORS is not enabled, so keys stay off the browser.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Food Info\n Email: info@food-info.org",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
  }
